      "explanation": "The workflow explicitly tells the assistant to run local scripts that read PDFs, generate JSON artifacts, and create modified output PDFs, but it does not clearly disclose these side effects to the user. In an agentic environment, this can lead to unintended file access or overwrites if the user does not realize the scope of the operations being performed.",
